Step 2/2: Reranker
A reranker improves recall quality but adds latency. Which option do you want to use?

[1] Cohere rerank-v3.5 (paid, recommended for best quality)
    Requires COHERE_API_KEY. No local CPU/RAM load. On error: recall continues without reranker.
[2] Local: BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3 (multilingual, no API key)
    Recommended for German/multilingual. Lazy loads on first recall. Uses CPU/RAM.
[3] No reranker (fastest and most stable baseline)
    Recall remains fully functional. No extra cost, no local model load.
[4] Advanced options (additional local models)
    Alibaba-NLP/gte-reranker-modernbert-base (English/long-context/code), jinaai/jina-reranker-v2-base-multilingual, mixedbread-ai/mxbai-rerank-base-v2
